{"ts": 1791256695.000972, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "Agent environments"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 15, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.4092384373520055}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7600005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.45672973051941623, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791256697.0558238, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s zoom in on the eval part since the quiz showed we should slow down there. A good way to write it is: define pass^k as the probability that all k evaluation runs succeed, so it measures reliability under repetition. If your build only succeeds sometimes, pass@k can look good even when the system is fragile; pass^k is stricter and better matches a Friday build goal.\n\nTry this quick check: if a system succeeds on 2 out of 3 independent runs, would pass@3 be high or low? Would pass^3 be high or low? Reply with your answer and I\u2019ll tell you if the intuition is right.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=15 messages 2m", "t": 17, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.5047833390615868}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7600005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.47672973051941625, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
